  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 508.01 Purpose. The purpose of family centered community-based home care shall be to support, but not supplant, the recipient’s family as the primary caregiver.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading He-W 500); ss by #5941, eff 12-22-94, EXPIRED: 12-22-02\n\nNew. #8196, INTERIM, eff 10-29-04, EXIRED: 7-1-05\n\nNew. #9291, eff 7-1-09",
